<div class="page-header"><h1>Become a Kitchen Cabinet Dealer in Utah</h1><p>Pinnacle Sales is the manufacturer's representative for Shiloh, Eclipse, Aspect, Pronorm German Kitchens, and Vistora Closets across Utah — recruiting and supporting kitchen & bath dealers from Salt Lake City and the Silicon Slopes corridor to the resort market in Park City, backed by 23+ years of in-market experience.</p></div>
<div class="content-narrow section">
<Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs} />

<h2 id="why-partner-with-pinnacle">Why Partner With Pinnacle Sales in Utah</h2>
<p>If you run a kitchen & bath showroom or design studio in Utah, Pinnacle Sales gives you a portfolio that spans every market tier — from semi-custom value built for the Wasatch Front's heavy new-construction volume to handleless German luxury for Park City and Deer Valley. You get protected territory, in-person line training, design and quoting support, and showroom merchandising backed by 23+ years of dealer relationships.</p>

<h2 id="lines-you-can-carry">Premium Lines You Can Carry in Utah</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/shiloh-cabinetry/">Shiloh Cabinetry</a></strong> — American-made custom paint, inset, and wide wood-species selection; the versatile choice for Utah's transitional and mountain-modern kitchens, with strong dealer margins.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry/">Eclipse Cabinetry</a></strong> — Frameless, full-access construction for the clean contemporary look that suits modern Salt Lake remodels.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/aspect-cabinetry/">Aspect Cabinetry</a></strong> — Value semi-custom built for the Wasatch Front and Utah County's high new-construction volume.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens/">Pronorm German Kitchens</a></strong> — Handleless, precision-engineered fronts for high-end Park City, Deer Valley, and luxury Salt Lake projects, with protected dealer territory.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/vistora-closets/">Vistora Closets</a></strong> — Made-to-order closets and storage to grow whole-home revenue.</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="utah-market-opportunity">The Utah Market Opportunity</h2>
<p>Utah is one of the West's busiest new-construction markets, with heavy volume along the Wasatch Front and in Utah County, a premium remodel market in Salt Lake's established neighborhoods — the Avenues, Holladay, Federal Heights — and ultra-high-end demand in Park City and Deer Valley. Utah kitchens blend clean transitional style with mountain-modern character: painted perimeters with stained islands, modern-shaker doors, and value-minded semi-custom drive the new-construction corridors, while the luxury resort market increasingly specs handleless <a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens/">Pronorm</a> and <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry/">frameless</a> fronts — a high-margin opportunity for dealers carrying the lines that fit the region's mountain-contemporary architecture.</p>

<h2 id="dealer-support">Dealer Support That Drives Sales</h2>
<p>Pinnacle Sales backs Utah dealers with hands-on sales training, 2020/Winner design and quoting support, showroom display programs, factory coordination, and ongoing business development. We work alongside your team to move projects from concept to order.</p>

